    "body": "I think you need to ease into the topic...\r\n- ECMA-262 has these things called \"abstract operations\".\r\n- Algorithms in Infra-based specs can invoke them.\r\n- The style of invoking them is different from how you invoke Infra-based algs.\r\n- Something about the correspondence between Infra values and 262 values.\r\n- Sometimes, the return value is a 'completion record'...",
